nd Hulu streaming services. Within the segment, Disney also engages in movie and television production and distribution, with content licensed to movie theaters, other content providers, or, increasingly, kept in-house for use on Disney&#x27;s own streaming platform and television networks. The sports segment houses the ESPN family of TV networks and streaming services. Experiences contains Disney&#x27;s theme parks, cruises, and vacation destinations and also engages in merchandise licensing.</p><button class=\"linkish\" type=\"button\" data-more>More</button></div><dl class=fields><dt>Industry</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"industry:entertainment\">Entertainment</a></dd><dt>Country</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"country:US\">United States</a></dd></dl><h3 class=\"sub\">Betas</h3><table class=\"cmp \"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"n\">Beta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:1\">S&amp;P 500</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.81</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:2\">Long Treasury yield</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.30</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:3\">US dollar against major currencies</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.30</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:4\">Crude oil price</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.00</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:5\">Semiconductor stocks</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.31</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:6\">Bitcoin</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.04</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 class=\"sub\">Events</h3><table class=\"ifs\"><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>If Yes</th><th>If No</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-k=\"ev:prop:4\"><td><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:4\">China blockades or attacks Taiwan by May 18, 2027</a><div class=\"aside\">Forecast 3.6%</div></td><td><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"